    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-14: `main()` calling `CliRunner().run(args)` resolves to the `CliRunner` class node rather than the `run` method. Forward slice does not traverse `contains` edges reached via a call, yielding 2 nodes (main + CliRunner class) instead of 19 nodes from slicing CliRunner directly. Fix: when call resolution lands on a class node, follow its `contains` edges to constructors/methods. Related to but distinct from WI-visaz (Kotlin extension call dispatch); see discussion note added there."  # 9190
